.Bl -tag -width NSH_MANUAL_PAGE
.It Ev EDITOR , VISUAL
The editor for a daemon's
.Cm edit :
VISUAL if it is set, else EDITOR, else
.Pa /usr/bin/vi .
.It Ev HOME
The directory that holds
.Pa ~/.nshenv .
.It Ev NSH_MANUAL_PAGE
The manual page displayed by the built-in
.Cm manual
